<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110753" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθόρ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>destructive</i>: esp. of
			means <i>to produce abortion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεσσός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Jusj.</u>
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἐμβούων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.67
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.60
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθόρια, τά,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθορεῖα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.164
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.134f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθόριον ἕδνον</span> sum given to a
			bride as compensation for loss of virginity, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				9.1075.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(v A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
